      <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: column;row-gap: 36px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;left: 57px;top: 355px;width: 1312px;position: absolute;">
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Project Background</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 528px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">GeGe is a local pancake shop whose name suggests the feeling of satisfaction after eating. The redesign develops this playful idea into a more distinctive identity while retaining the shop’s familiar pink colour palette.</span></div>
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Design Scope</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 528px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Logo Redesign · Custom Lettering · Character Illustration · Packaging · Brand Applications</span></div>
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Design Approach</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 528px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Rounded and inflated letterforms reference the soft texture of pancakes, while melting and bitten details introduce associations with butter, sweetness and appetite. The lettering, colour palette and character illustration are extended across different touchpoints to create a friendly and cohesive visual language.</span></div>
      </div>
